--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LICENCE STATUS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is a deliberate choice, not an oversight. The project is source-available
rather than open source.

Releasing it under a permissive licence is irreversible in practice: anyone who
obtains a copy under such terms keeps those rights permanently, even if the
licence is changed later. Choosing the restrictive default keeps every option
open, including adopting a permissive licence at any future date.
